### Dashboard administrativo
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Dashboard sin autenticación
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/dashboard

### 1. Listar usuarios
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 2. Segunda página, cinco usuarios
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users?page=2&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 3. Filtrar vendedores
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users?role=seller
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 4. Buscar por nombre o email
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users?search=adrian
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5. Combinar filtros
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users?role=seller&search=tcg&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 6. Comprobar validación del rol
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users?role=superadmin
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 7. Comprobar el límite máximo
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users?limit=101
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}



### Detalle de un usuario existente
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Usuario inexistente
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ID inválido
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users/abc
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### Desactivar una tienda
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/sellers/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

### Reactivar una tienda
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/sellers/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": true
}

### Estado inválido
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/sellers/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": "false"
}

### Perfil inexistente
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/sellers/999999/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}


